  "builds_on": "FiniteWignerKernel imports BornHermitianCarrier (the Gaussian-rational carrier, its readout hf and the rank-one effects P x whose Born readout is the transition probability) and BornHermitianPsdDecomposition (hf_single, hf_add_vec, mulVec_single'); FiniteWignerSimilarity imports SectorFormHermitian for the coordinate action permute of the H006 permutation envelope; GaussRatAutomorphisms imports BornGaussRat. The sector-form run fixed the inner product up to a unit scale, which is why the transition probability (scale-free) is the right invariant to impose on the dynamics; this run is item 2 of its next_steps.md.",
